<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's CVRD nets 280 mln reais Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CVRD nets 280 mln reais Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) issued the following statement with its results in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>			  Jan-Sept 1996	    Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p> Net shr profit		 0.72 real		 0.54</p>
<p> Net profit		    280 million		   209 million</p>
<p> Gross revenue		 2.171 bln		  2.159 bln</p>
<p>Note: all figures are in Brazilian reais</p>
<p>Sales of iron ore and pellets totalled 77,483 tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, of which 53,934 were sold in the international market and 23,549 in the domestic market, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
